   "notes": "MMA is the mineral/DELFT (Verduyn-type) medium of ref 37 with 27.3 g/L sodium acetate (= 20 g/L acetic acid) as sole carbon source, pH 6.0; the paper's main text gives only the bulk salts, acetate and stock-solution volumes, so all 10 trace metals and 7 vitamins were recovered from the cited EasyClone/Delft recipe. Organism is Yarrowia lipolytica grown aerobically (bioreactor DO maintained at 20%). Current_components previously listed only generic ion exchanges; calcium, all micronutrient metals and all vitamins were absent."
